{
  "name": "lacquer-theme",
  "displayName": "Lacquer Theme — Black lacquer, vermilion, gold leaf and abalone shell inlay",
  "description": "Black lacquer, vermilion, gold leaf and abalone shell inlay. A lacquer box is built up coat by coat until its surface goes deep and still, then decorated with vermilion, sprinkled gold and slivers of abalone shell. Every code colour measured: body te",
